WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.302
A few miles down the road, Willie and his grandfather brought me to a halt in front of a pretty cottage.

2
00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:13.408
The farmer went to the door while Willie stayed with me.

3
00:00:13.409 --> 00:00:16.224
Three ladies came out of the house.

4
00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:19.411
One was tall and pale and wrapped in a shawl.

5
00:00:19.412 --> 00:00:24.943
She was leaning on the arm of a younger lady with dark eyes and a cheerful face.

6
00:00:24.944 --> 00:00:28.296
The third lady was tall with a kind smile.

7
00:00:28.297 --> 00:00:31.368
They all came over to see me.

8
00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:37.227
The cheerful younger lady, whose name was Miss Ellen, seemed to take to me right away.

9
00:00:37.228 --> 00:00:43.701
"He has a good face," she said, giving me a pat. "I like him already!"

10
00:00:43.702 --> 00:00:48.078
The tall, pale lady, Miss Lavinia, glanced at my knees.

11
00:00:48.079 --> 00:00:51.401
"I don't know," she said.

12
00:00:51.402 --> 00:00:56.497
"I'd always be nervous riding behind a horse that's fallen down before."

13
00:00:56.498 --> 00:01:03.151
"Many fine horses have scars on their knees, thanks to careless drivers," the farmer said.

14
00:01:03.152 --> 00:01:06.582
"I suspect that's what happened to this horse.

15
00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:09.767
But I don't blame you for being cautious.

16
00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:15.477
If you like, you can take him on trial for a while and see what your coachman thinks of him."

17
00:01:15.478 --> 00:01:18.752
The tall lady, Miss Blomefield, nodded.

18
00:01:18.753 --> 00:01:23.453
"You've never steered us wrong on a horse yet," she told the farmer.

19
00:01:23.454 --> 00:01:28.349
"If my sisters agree, we'll gladly give him a try."

20
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:32.406
The next day a handsome young man arrived to pick me up.

21
00:01:32.407 --> 00:01:39.357
At first he looked pleased. Then he saw my knees and his expression changed.

22
00:01:39.358 --> 00:01:44.107
"I didn't think you'd recommend a blemished horse to the ladies, sir," he told the farmer.

23
00:01:44.108 --> 00:01:49.126
"I know you're a good judge of horses, young man," the farmer replied.

24
00:01:49.127 --> 00:01:51.311
"Just give him a fair trial.

25
00:01:51.312 --> 00:01:56.769
I think you'll see that he's the safest horse you could want for your ladies."

26
00:01:56.770 --> 00:02:00.689
The young man agreed and led me back to the ladies' home.

27
00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:08.425
I was put into a comfortable stall. The young man fed me and left me to rest.

28
00:02:08.426 --> 00:02:14.853
The next day, after I'd finished my breakfast, he took me out of my stall and started to groom me.

29
00:02:14.854 --> 00:02:20.106
He pushed aside my forelock to brush my face, and then stopped.

30
00:02:20.107 --> 00:02:24.287
"That looks just like the star Black Beauty had," he murmured.

31
00:02:24.288 --> 00:02:29.772
"This horse is about the same height too. I wonder where old Beauty is now."

32
00:02:29.773 --> 00:02:33.911
He continued with his grooming.

33
00:02:33.912 --> 00:02:37.752
Soon he came to the little knot I'd had in my neck for

34
00:02:37.753 --> 00:02:40.521
years. The groom looked

35
00:02:40.522 --> 00:02:46.630
startled. He began to look me over carefully, talking to himself all the

36
00:02:46.631 --> 00:02:52.589
while. "White star, one white foot, this little knot just in that spot . .

37
00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:55.704
. "I can't believe it, here's the little patch of white hair on his back

38
00:02:55.705 --> 00:03:00.748
too! Oh Beauty, it is you! Black Beauty, do you remember

39
00:03:00.749 --> 00:03:04.042
me? It's Joe, Little Joe

40
00:03:04.043 --> 00:03:08.978
Green!" He began patting me all over, laughing with

41
00:03:08.979 --> 00:03:14.561
delight. I can't say I would have recognized him, all grown up as he

42
00:03:14.562 --> 00:03:19.358
was. I put my nose up to him to show him that I knew we were

43
00:03:19.359 --> 00:03:23.106
friends. "Give you a fair trial!" Little Joe exclaimed with a

44
00:03:23.107 --> 00:03:28.428
laugh. "I should think so! I wonder who ruined your knees, my old

45
00:03:28.429 --> 00:03:31.525
Beauty. You must have had some hard times somewhere along the

46
00:03:31.526 --> 00:03:35.656
way. But you'll have only the best from now on if I have anything to do with

47
00:03:35.657 --> 00:03:39.772
it! I only wish John Manly were here to see

48
00:03:39.773 --> 00:03:43.683
you." That afternoon Little Joe harnessed me and brought me to the

49
00:03:43.684 --> 00:03:49.734
house. Miss Ellen came out to try me, with Little Joe riding

50
00:03:49.735 --> 00:03:53.599
along. She was a good driver and seemed pleased with my

51
00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:59.249
paces. Little Joe told her that he was sure I was Squire Gordon's old Black

52
00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:03.830
Beauty. When we returned, Miss Ellen told her sisters all about

53
00:04:03.831 --> 00:04:10.133
it. "I'll write to Mrs. Gordon right away and let her know her favorite horse has come to us," she

54
00:04:10.134 --> 00:04:13.249
said. "She'll be so happy to hear

55
00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:18.315
it!" The sisters drove me every day for the next

56
00:04:18.316 --> 00:04:23.317
week. Even Miss Lavinia finally found the courage to ride along with the

57
00:04:23.318 --> 00:04:27.839
others. They decided to keep me and call me by my old name of Black

58
00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:33.283
Beauty. That was a year ago, and I'm still with them and as happy as I've ever

59
00:04:33.284 --> 00:04:37.263
been. Little Joe and the ladies treat me

60
00:04:37.264 --> 00:04:44.263
kindly. My work is easy and pleasant, and my strength and spirits are

61
00:04:44.264 --> 00:04:51.978
back. Willie and his grandfather come to visit often, and the ladies have promised never to sell

62
00:04:51.979 --> 00:04:58.668
me. And so this is where my story ends. My troubles are all over, and I am at

63
00:04:58.669 --> 00:05:14.582
home. Often, before I am quite awake, I imagine that I am still in the orchard at Birtwick Park, standing with my old friends under the apple

64
00:05:14.583 --> 00:05:51.798
trees.

